    "media:imagetext": "HAROLD MC MILLAN BIXBY\nBOLTON LANDING, N. Y.\nSept. 27th\nDear Emmy Lou:\nI'm enclosing copy of letter to Mark Darling which will be self\nexplanatory.\nIs there anything new with you?\nWhen are you going south?\nOur plans are very much up in the air and we wont know for another\ntwo weeks or so what our ETA Captiva will be.\nWe have had a fine summer. To borrow a phrase from Lincoln - we\nhave had some of the grandchildren all of the time, all of the\ngrandchildren some of the time but thank goodness we haven't had\nall of the grandchildren all of the time!\nHope you have had a grand summer and are ready to lead the child-\nren of Tallahassee into the Promised Land or should I say marshes.\nSincerely",
    "media:imagetext_created": 1787971937,
